<main data-writer-document>
<header class="title-block">
<h1 class="title">References and citations</h1>
</header>
<h1 id="sec-x"><span class="number">1</span> A numbered section</h1>
<p>See <a class="ref" href="#sec-x">Section 1</a>, <a class="ref" href="#sec-x">Chapter 1</a>, <a class="ref" href="#fig-x">Fig. 1</a>, <a class="ref" href="#eq-x">Equation 1</a>, and <a class="ref" href="#eq-x">1</a>.</p>
<figure id="fig-x" class="figure kind-image">
<img src="asset:000000000001" alt="A referenced figure">
<figcaption><span class="caption-label">Figure 1:</span> A referenced figure</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="eq-x" class="equation numbered"><span class="math display" data-math-style="display" data-tex="x = 1">x = 1</span><span class="equation-number">(1)</span></div>
<h2 id="sec-unnumbered" class="unnumbered">An unnumbered heading</h2>
<p>A reference to an unnumbered heading: <a class="ref" href="#sec-unnumbered">An unnumbered heading</a>.</p>
<h2 id="results-and-discussion"><span class="number">1.1</span> Results and discussion</h2>
<p>See <a href="#results-and-discussion">the results</a>.</p>
<figure id="fig-a" class="figure kind-image">
<img src="asset:000000000001" alt="First figure">
<figcaption><span class="caption-label">Figure 2:</span> First figure</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="fig-b" class="figure kind-image">
<img src="asset:000000000002" alt="Second figure">
<figcaption><span class="caption-label">Figure 3:</span> Second figure</figcaption>
</figure>
<p>A label group <a class="ref" href="#fig-a">Figure 2</a>, <a class="ref" href="#fig-b">Figure 3</a>.</p>
<p>Citations <span class="unresolved-reference">[?doe2020; lee2019]</span>, <span class="unresolved-reference">[?knuth1984]</span>, and <span class="unresolved-reference">[?doe2020]</span>.</p>
<p>Write @literal for an at sign and keep the dot after <a class="ref" href="#x">Section 1.1.1</a>.</p>
<h3 id="x"><span class="number">1.1.1</span> A trailing punctuation target</h3>
<h3 id="sec-duplicate"><span class="number">1.1.2</span> A duplicate label</h3>
<h3 id="sec-duplicate"><span class="number">1.1.3</span> Another duplicate label</h3>
<h3 id="fn-1"><span class="number">1.1.4</span> A reserved label</h3>
</main>
